{
  "name": "ClinicalTrials.gov API v2 Daily Sponsor & Phase 3 Watch -> Google Sheets & Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "trigger-daily-8am",
      "name": "Daily 08:00 Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/yannabadie~clinical-trials-api-mcp/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "={{$env.APIFY_TOKEN}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"mode\": \"search\",\n  \"condition\": \"oncology\",\n  \"overallStatus\": [\"RECRUITING\", \"NOT_YET_RECRUITING\"],\n  \"phases\": [\"PHASE2\", \"PHASE3\"],\n  \"funderType\": \"INDUSTRY\",\n  \"updatedSince\": \"{{$now.minus({days: 2}).toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd')}}\",\n  \"maxResults\": 50\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "apify-ctg-call",
      "name": "Fetch Updated Clinical Trials",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "valid-nct",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.nctId}}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "filter-valid-ncts",
      "name": "Keep Valid NCT Studies",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        740,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "ClinicalTrials",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "nctId": "={{$json.nctId}}",
            "status": "={{$json.overallStatus}}",
            "phases": "={{($json.phases || []).join(', ')}}",
            "leadSponsor": "={{$json.leadSponsor}}",
            "briefTitle": "={{$json.briefTitle}}",
            "enrollmentCount": "={{$json.enrollmentCount}}",
            "primaryContactEmail": "={{$json.primaryContactEmail}}",
            "primaryContactPhone": "={{$json.primaryContactPhone}}",
            "lastUpdated": "={{$json.lastUpdatePostedDate}}",
            "studyUrl": "={{$json.studyUrl}}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "nctId"
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "sheets-upsert",
      "name": "Upsert into Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1020,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{$env.SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL}}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"text\": \"Clinical Trial Update [{{$json.nctId}} | {{($json.phases || []).join('/')}}]: *{{$json.briefTitle}}*\\nSponsor: {{$json.leadSponsor}} | Enrollment: {{$json.enrollmentCount || 'N/A'}}\\nContact: {{$json.primaryContactEmail || 'N/A'}} {{$json.primaryContactPhone || ''}}\\nLink: {{$json.studyUrl}}\"\n}"
      },
      "id": "slack-alert",
      "name": "Send Slack Pipeline Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1020,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ClinicalTrials.gov API v2 Sponsor Watch\n1. Set n8n env vars `APIFY_TOKEN` and `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL`.\n2. Customize `condition`, `phases`, `funderType`, and `overallStatus` in **Fetch Updated Clinical Trials**.\n3. Replace `REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` and run once manually to verify columns before enabling daily schedule.",
        "height": 195,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-setup",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Deduplicated Trial Pipeline\n- **Keep Valid NCT Studies** filters records with a valid `nctId`.\n- **Upsert into Google Sheets** matches on `nctId` to update recruitment/phase changes cleanly.\n- Posts sponsor, enrollment, and primary contact email/phone to Slack.",
        "height": 165,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-output",
      "name": "Idempotent NCT Tracking",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        40
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Daily 08:00 Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch Updated Clinical Trials",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Fetch Updated Clinical Trials": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Keep Valid NCT Studies",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Keep Valid NCT Studies": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Upsert into Google Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Send Slack Pipeline Alert",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "instanceId": "yannabadie-clinical-trials-template-v1"
  }
}
